6908703	 &lt;P_f_Footnote&gt;For the reading &lt;SP_f_AO_3a_Hittite&gt;en-tíš&lt;/SP_f_AO_3a_Hittite&gt; &lt;SP_f_AO_3a_SumGRAM&gt;GÙB&lt;/SP_f_AO_3a_SumGRAM&gt;&lt;SP_f_AO_3a_Hittite&gt;-aš&lt;/SP_f_AO_3a_Hittite&gt; see KUB 16.29 + KUB 16.81 obv. 16 (&lt;SP_f_AO_3a_Hittite&gt;en-tíš&lt;/SP_f_AO_3a_Hittite&gt; &lt;SP_f_AO_3a_SumGRAM&gt;GÚB&lt;/SP_f_AO_3a_SumGRAM&gt;&lt;SP_f_AO_3a_Hittite&gt;-aš&lt;/SP_f_AO_3a_Hittite&gt; &lt;SP_f_AO_3a_Hittite&gt;ma-zé-ri-eš&lt;/SP_f_AO_3a_Hittite&gt; &lt;SP_f_AO_3a_SumGRAM&gt;ZAG&lt;/SP_f_AO_3a_SumGRAM&gt;&lt;SP_f_AO_3a_Hittite&gt;-aš&lt;/SP_f_AO_3a_Hittite&gt; &lt;SP_f_AO_3a_SumGRAM&gt;EGIR&lt;/SP_f_AO_3a_SumGRAM&gt;&lt;SP_f_AO_3a_AkkGRAM&gt;-ŠÚ&lt;/SP_f_AO_3a_AkkGRAM&gt; &lt;SP_f_AO_3a_SumGRAM&gt;NU.TUKU&lt;/SP_f_AO_3a_SumGRAM&gt; &quot;the &lt;SP_f_AO_3a_Hittite&gt;enti&lt;/SP_f_AO_3a_Hittite&gt; of the left side; the &lt;SP_f_AO_3a_Hittite&gt;mazeri&lt;/SP_f_AO_3a_Hittite&gt; of the right side, its back is not there&quot;) and KUB 22.51 2′: &lt;SP_f_AO_3a_Hittite&gt;en-tíš&lt;/SP_f_AO_3a_Hittite&gt; &lt;SP_f_AO_3a_SumGRAM&gt;GÙB&lt;/SP_f_AO_3a_SumGRAM&gt;&lt;SP_f_AO_3a_Hittite&gt;-aš&lt;/SP_f_AO_3a_Hittite&gt; &lt;SP_f_AO_3a_SumGRAM&gt;&lt;laes_in/&gt;GAR&lt;laes_fin/&gt;&lt;/SP_f_AO_3a_SumGRAM&gt;&lt;SP_f_AO_3a_Hittite&gt;-&lt;del_in/&gt;ri&lt;/SP_f_AO_3a_Hittite&gt; &quot;the &lt;SP_f_AO_3a_Hittite&gt;enti&lt;/SP_f_AO_3a_Hittite&gt; of the right side is placed / is lying&quot;&lt;SP_f_AO_3a_Hittite&gt;).&lt;/SP_f_AO_3a_Hittite&gt; For the alternative reading &lt;SP_f_AO_3a_Hittite&gt;en-tíš&lt;/SP_f_AO_3a_Hittite&gt; &lt;SP_f_AO_3a_SumGRAM&gt;GÙB&lt;/SP_f_AO_3a_SumGRAM&gt;&lt;SP_f_AO_3a_Hittite&gt;-la-aš&lt;/SP_f_AO_3a_Hittite&gt; see KBo 55.204 + KUB 5.9 obv. 24. &lt;/P_f_Footnote&gt;
